---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
const title = "Front-End Developer";
const description = "Crayonweb is looking for a Front-End Developer to build responsive, user-friendly web interfaces and deliver seamless digital experiences.";
const canonical = "https://stage.woodwolfdigital.com/front-end-developer/";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} type="website">
  <div class="container" style="padding:3rem 1rem">
    <h1>Front-End Developer</h1>
    <p>Crayonweb is looking for a Front-End Developer to build responsive, user-friendly web interfaces and deliver seamless digital experiences.</p>
    <h2>Job Details</h2>
    <ul><li>Vacancy: No of Vacancies: 03</li></ul>
<ul>
      <li>Location: Bhavnagar-Gujarat</li>
      <li>Date: 29 August 2025</li>
      <li>Job Type: Full Time (On Site)</li>
      <li>Working Hours: 10 AM to 07 PM</li>
      <li>Working Days: Weekly 6 days (Mon to Sat)</li>
      <li>Salary: As Per Eligibility</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Build Seamless Digital Experiences</h2>
    <p>CrayonWeb is looking for a talented and passionate Front-End Developer to join our innovative digital team. In this role, you will be responsible for developing responsive, user-friendly web interfaces and translating design concepts into high-quality code. You will work closely with UI/UX designers, back-end developers, and project managers to create engaging digital experiences that meet client objectives. As a Front-End Developer, you will implement modern web technologies such as HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and popular frameworks like React or Next.js. You will optimize applications for speed, accessibility, and performance, ensuring seamless functionality across devices and browsers. Collaboration with the team will be key as you contribute to planning, coding, testing, and delivering projects that exceed client expectations. At CrayonWeb, we value innovation, creativity, and continuous learning. This role provides the opportunity to work on diverse projects, explore cutting-edge technologies, and enhance your development skills. Our inclusive and supportive work environment encourages your ideas, recognizes your contributions, and nurtures your professional growth.</p>
    <h2>requirements</h2>
    <p>Experience: At least 1 year</p>
    <h3>Additional Requirements</h3>
<h4>Technical Skills</h4><ul><li>Proficiency in HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, with strong understanding of web standards and best practices</li><li>Experience with front-end frameworks/libraries such as React, Next.js, or Vue.js</li><li>Knowledge of responsive and mobile-first design principles</li><li>Familiarity with version control systems (e.g. Git) and package managers (npm, Yarn)</li><li>Understanding of cross-browser compatibility, accessibility, and performance optimization</li><li>Experience with API integration and basic understanding of back-end concepts</li></ul>
    <h4>Preferred Experience (a plus)</h4><ul><li>Familiarity with UI/UX principles and design tools (Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch)</li><li>Experience with CSS preprocessors like Sass or LESS</li><li>Understanding of SEO best practices for front-end development</li><li>Knowledge of testing frameworks and code optimization techniques</li></ul>
    <h4>Soft Skills</h4><ul><li>Problem-Solving: Ability to troubleshoot issues and find efficient solutions</li><li>Communication Skills: Clearly convey technical concepts to designers, developers, and non-technical stakeholders</li><li>Attention to Detail: Ensure pixel-perfect implementation and maintain high-quality code standards</li><li>Teamwork &amp; Collaboration: Work effectively with designers, developers, and project managers</li><li>Adaptability: Learn and adopt new technologies and frameworks as needed</li><li>Time Management: Handle multiple tasks and meet project deadlines efficiently</li></ul>
    <h2>Email your CV</h2>
    <p>Send your CV to the given email <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a></p>
    <h2>Apply Position</h2>
<form>
      <p><label>Your first name<br /><input type="text" name="first_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your last name<br /><input type="text" name="last_name" /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your email address *<br /><input type="email" name="email" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your phone number *<br /><input type="tel" name="phone" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Working Experience *<br /><input type="text" name="experience" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Upload CV *<br /><input type="file" name="cv" required /></label></p>
      <p><label>Your message<br /><textarea name="message" rows="5"></textarea></label></p>
      <p><button type="submit">Submit</button></p>
    </form>
    <p>Note: this form is front end only on this staging site, so nothing is sent. Email your CV to <a href="mailto:hr@crayonwebstudio.com">hr@crayonwebstudio.com</a> instead.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
